        "id": 1365249
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-08-18T20:27:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Prefer to do this `attention` bit mapping in the RTS driver instead. Since this is common, you\u0027ll have incorrect behavior on TI systems.",
